{"id":"01_5938","type":"item","name":{"ja":"30MM 1/144 eEXM-40 イグライト 01","en":"30MM 1/144 eEXM-40 Iglite 01"},"description":[{"ja":"地球連合軍から、機能性と生産性を兼ね備えた新たな主力量産機「イグライト」がロールアウト！！","en":"The Earth Allied Forces has rolled out the new flagship mass-produced machine \"Iglight\", which combines functionality and productivity! !"},{"ja":"• 30MMシリーズにより手を伸ばしやすくなるエントリーモデルが新登場。初心者にもスターターとしておすすめできる商品仕様。","en":"• The 30MM series introduces a new entry model that is easier to reach. Product specifications that can be recommended as a starter for beginners."},{"ja":"• シリーズの看板機体が「アルト」から「イグライト」に交代。","en":"• The series' signature aircraft was changed from \"Alto \" to \" Iglite.\""},{"ja":"• パーツ・ジョイントを簡略化し、さらに早く、簡単に組み立てられる。","en":"• Simplify parts and joints for faster and easier assembly."},{"ja":"• 30MMシリーズとしては初のタッチゲートを採用。ニッパーなしでより手軽に、より早く簡単に組み立てられる仕様を追求。","en":"• First touch gate adopted in the 30MM series. Pursuing specifications that allow easier, faster assembly without nippers."},{"ja":"• スリムな造形に、シリーズ共通の3mmジョイントを多数配置。","en":"• Many 3mm joints common to the series are placed in the slim design."},{"ja":"• 30MMの支援メカ「ロイロイ」が新デザインで2体付属。1キットで部隊感を手軽に楽しめる。","en":"• Two newly designed 30MM support mecha \"Roi-Roi\" are included. You can easily enjoy the feeling of a military unit with 1Kit."},{"ja":"• ロイロイはそれぞれ変形してイグライトの武器として使用できる。","en":"• Each Loi Loi can be transformed and used as an Iglite weapon."},{"ja":"• 腕部に可動する3mmジョイントを新搭載。約180度回転するため、装備や装甲を様々な方向から接続できる。","en":"• Newly equipped with a movable 3mm joint in the arm. It rotates approximately 180 degrees, allowing you to connect equipment and armor from various directions."}],"accessories":[{"ja":"ロイロイ×2種","en":"Loi Loi x 2 types"}],"contents":[],"images":["https://d3bk8pkqsprcvh.cloudfront.net/hobby/jp/product/2025/07/qNJjbmzUI9uLDYhk/BtZND5ZATR5X9Xvg.jpeg?Expires=1765044112&Key-Pair-Id=K7AVJM1114TH7&Signature=BvPpAdkQGMTn7s39gsIL2GK0IKu6x27Us3KxLTBcWarhoiRcgpDfuV3QmMw6Rvecd5PuMvn2a4Xo41G1DSBAcD8jNs74qHtVW52ANen1gn1TywWegeNH54nN